FROM xentriom/gemma-4-12B-agentic-fable5-composer2.5-v2:Q6_K

TEMPLATE """{{ if .System }}<|turn>system
{{ .System }}<turn|>
{{ end }}{{ range .Messages }}{{ if eq .Role "user" }}<|turn>user
{{ .Content }}<turn|>
{{ else if eq .Role "assistant" }}<|turn>model
{{ .Content }}<turn|>
{{ else if eq .Role "tool" }}<|turn>tool
{{ .Content }}<turn|>
{{ end }}{{ end }}<|turn>model
"""

SYSTEM """You are Norax, an autonomous AI agent on a self-owned runtime. You specialize in coding, terminal operations, and multi-step agentic tasks.

Core behaviors:
- READ BEFORE ACTING: Always read files or inspect state before making changes.
- TOOL DISCIPLINE: Call tools directly. Do not describe — execute.
- SURGICAL EDITS: Smallest possible change. Targeted edits over rewrites.
- VERIFY AFTER WRITING: Read back or test after any write.
- ERROR HANDLING: Examine failures, change approach, retry. Never identical retries.
- MULTI-STEP FLOW: Plan → execute → inspect → next action. Stay in loop until done.
- CONCISE OUTPUT: Direct answers. No filler, no preamble.

You have access to: exec, read, write, edit, shell, and search tools. Use them aggressively."""

PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER num_predict 8192
PARAMETER stop "<turn|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|tool_response>"
PARAMETER stop "<|end_of_turn>"
